{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a clean, modern “Why Choose Us?” section for a medical-supply ecommerce website.
    
    STYLE REQUIREMENTS
    
    White background with lots of spacing and a clean, healthcare-friendly aesthetic
    
    6 feature cards arranged in a responsive 3×2 grid
    
    Each card has:
    
    A thin light-green border (#6CC16E or similar)
    
    Rounded corners (12–16px)
    
    A minimal line icon at the top
    
    Bold title
    
    Short descriptive paragraph
    
    Hover effect:
    
    Light green glow/shadow behind the card
    
    Slight upward movement (2–4px)
    
    Smooth transition (0.3s)
    
    Icons should be outline-style, medical or business themed
    
    Typography: clean sans-serif (Inter, Poppins, or similar)
    
    CONTENT FOR EACH CARD (use this copy exactly)
    
    1️⃣ 500K+ Served
    We’ve supported over half a million customers with dependable, competitively priced medical supplies. Our long-standing reputation reflects two decades of trusted service.
    
    2️⃣ B2B Excellence
    We specialize in serving healthcare facilities, government agencies, and professional buyers with efficient procurement, bulk pricing, and seamless fulfillment.
    
    3️⃣ Trusted Supply
    We partner directly with leading manufacturers, ensuring you receive only authentic, compliant, and fully authorized medical products.
    
    4️⃣ Veteran-Owned
    As a certified Service-Disabled Veteran-Owned Small Business, we uphold the highest standards of integrity, discipline, and accountability in every partnership.
    
    5️⃣ FDA Compliant
    We distribute FDA-approved products that meet stringent healthcare and safety standards, ensuring accuracy, reliability, and clinical trust.
    
    6️⃣ Easy Returns
    Our 30-day return policy provides confidence and flexibility, making your purchasing experience simple, safe, and hassle-free.
    
    Include a prominent headline:
    “Why Choose Us?”
    Subheading: “Find out what makes us different and why thousands of customers trust us.”
    
    Make the entire section clean, structured, symmetrical, and visually premium., In the mobile version, it is showing 6 cards continuously from up to down. Can you instead add a scroll right button.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
